{
  "_comment": "Manifest-entry attributes specific to @shexjs/neighborhood-wikibase, stacked onto ../../doc/webapp-manifest-context.jsonld's core. An entry that names this neighborhood (neighborhood: wikibase, a core attribute) writes this backend's own parameters under one `wikibase:parms` mapping -- base, sitematrix, pages, cacheDir, bare inside it -- and the property-scoped @context on that term (JSON-LD 1.1) expands them to wikibase: IRIs, so they can't collide with another backend's same-shaped attribute (compare neighborhood-sparql's own, differently-typed, endpoint). Tentative home, as with neighborhood-sparql: this reads Wikibase's own entity-page JSON, not anything ShEx-specific, so a wikidata- or Wikibase-tooling namespace may be a better long-term home for it.",

  "@context": {
    "@version": 1.1,
    "wikibase": "http://shex.io/neighborhoods/wikibase#",

    "wikibase:parms": {
      "@id": "wikibase:parms",
      "@context": {
        "base": {"@id": "wikibase:base", "@type": "@id"},
        "sitematrix": {"@id": "wikibase:sitematrix", "@type": "@id"},
        "pages": {"@id": "wikibase:pages", "@type": "@id", "@container": "@set"},
        "cacheDir": "wikibase:cacheDir"
      }
    }
  }
}
